<title>JAPAN: Ohba to issue 40 mln Sfr convertible.</title>
<headline>Ohba to issue 40 mln Sfr convertible.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Ohba Co Ltd</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Yamaichi Bank (Switzerland)</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	    ISSUE NO	   AMT   40 million Sfr</p>
<p> COUPON			  ISSU PRICE PAR   MATURITY 30.Sep.00</p>
<p> CONV PRICE		    CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Oct.96	  CONV TO 22.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 17.Sep.96    INT PAY end-Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE		 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI		 LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price, and currency rate will be decided on September 4.</p>
</text>
